*  The same defect with IDENT as the failing guard instead of GT -- proves the class is ANY failing
*  predicate, not a GT special case, so no per-op cure is admissible (NO-PER-OP-FILTER).
        A = 0
        'abcdef'       IDENT(A, 1) LEN(A - 10) . ind       :S(M)F(NM)
M       OUTPUT = 'matched'                                 :(DONE)
NM      OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
DONE    OUTPUT = 'end'
END
